# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# QRAW Encoder .gitignore
# Keep the repo to source + docs + patches. Everything below is reproducible
# from a build, or is a measurement of one machine on one day.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- build trees -----------------------------------------------------------
build/
builddir/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.d
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
compile_commands.json
.ninja_deps
.ninja_log
*.ninja

# --- compiled tools that must be BUILT, not committed ----------------------
# These link Adobe DNG SDK and GPR code. Shipping binaries pulls in
# binary-form redistribution duties for no benefit. Build them instead.
tools/gpr_tools
tools/dng_validate
tools/qraw_stats_cli
benchmark/quant_matrix/gpr_view
benchmark/cinepi_qraw_bench/build/
benchmark/build/

# --- large sample media ----------------------------------------------------
# Ship the 16 MB IMX585 reference frame as a GitHub Release asset, not in git.
*.raw16
*.gpr
*.dng
*.DNG
*.mp4

# --- run state, logs, measurements -----------------------------------------
.run.*
.build_verified
.static_winner_verified
*.log
output/logs/
output/results/
vc5_bench.log

# --- per-camera calibration (belongs to a rig, not to the project) ---------
cinepi_wb_base.json
cinepi_liveview.json

# --- python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# --- editors / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- explicit keeps --------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore is greedy above; re-admit the things that must ship.
!benchmark/testdata/*.log
!benchmark/cinepi_qraw_bench/input/README.md
